	(text "5V IN ONLY (J6 = regulated 5V from the battery-box DC-DC, never raw battery voltage)\nJ6 pin1 = +5V, pin2 = GND -> Q1 reverse-polarity guard -> +5V rail (no fuse: F6 removed 2026-09-30)\nUSB rule: unplug J6 before flashing over USB (Q1 conducts both ways when the rail is up).\nUSB-only (J6 empty) is for bench tests only"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 436.88 30.48 0)
